From e3f418e53d733e1a5513697d27f8052634a40b79 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 09:40:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Student & Subjects module: discontinue status, ID card,
 test/marksheet actions, department-aware list filters, categorized subject
 master list, and subject-requirement assignment UI

- Add DISCONTINUED status (with reason/date) to Student, plus a confirm-page flow
- Add a full printable Student ID Card (front/back)
- Add a Test/Marksheet page per student linking to exam results and result cards
- Wire the existing Group filter on the student list (was present in UI but unused)
- Add a Department context filter (Office/Exam/Accounts) that changes which actions show
- Add Subject.category (Compulsory/Optional/4th Subject/Vocational/Religion/Other)
- Rebuild the Subjects page as a searchable, category-grouped list
- Add a full Subject Assignment CRUD flow (SubjectRequirement) so institution/class/group
  subject setup no longer requires the Django admin
- Add a seed_subjects management command preloading common Bangladesh curriculum subjects
---
